 107 000413  0000  VCTEXT, .-.     / Display text on screen, using inline params
 108                               / Inline param1: Address of text string
 109                               / Return follows with AC = 0
 110                               / Text is packed 6-bit stripped ASCII,
 111                               / where @ marks end of string and % is CRLF.
 112                               / Uses: VCvariables
 113 000414  7200          CLA
 114 000415  1613          TAD I   VCTEXT  / get text pointer
 115 000416  3236          DCA     VCTXPT
 116 000417  2213          ISZ     VCTEXT  / bump
 117               VCTLP,
 118 000420  1636          TAD I   VCTXPT  / get a pair of characters
 119 000421  7002          BSW
 120 000422  0235          AND     C077    / extract first
 121 000423  7450          SNA             / test for end of string
 122 000424  5613          JMP I   VCTEXT  /   if so, return
 123 000425  4237          JMS     VCCHAR  / else display it
 124 000426  1636          TAD I   VCTXPT
 125 000427  0235          AND     C077    / extract second
 126 000430  7450          SNA             / test for end of string
